<title>USA: Harmony Brook completes debt financing.</title>
<headline>Harmony Brook completes debt financing.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harmony Brook Inc said Tuesday it completed a private placement of subordinated debt totaling $1 million.</p>
<p>It will use the proceeds to reduce outstanding debt with its senior lenders and to fund capital expenditures.</p>
<p>Harmony also said it reached an agreement with its senior bank lender to restructure its outstanding debt into a five-year term note.</p>
<p>Harmony Brook develops and manufactures equipment that purifies tap water.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
